This is a work in progress! I have been reverse engineering the Poly TC8 Touch Screen video conference controller.
It runs a custom Android OS but I was able to extract the firmware and get the device tree and
I'm working building a custom linux image to run on it.

This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-poly-tc8 layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

